{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026LTu8vh7iFI1795082961.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天文台再下調明天氣溫預測，市區最低約14度。</p><p></p><p>受強烈東北季候風及雲雨帶影響，氣溫顯著下降，下午多區錄得18至21度，較昨日低約五度。</p><p></p><p>天文台發出特別天氣提示，指今晚及明天顯著轉涼，明天市區進一步下降至約14度，新界再低一兩度。新界部分地區因高地寒冷加上風寒效應，提醒市民注意保暖。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-1730_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Qn2wZpKAkI1795083045.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>而隨著覆蓋廣東的雲帶周六轉薄，日夜溫差較大，早上仍然相當清涼，而一股達強風程度的偏東氣流，下周初影響華南沿岸，氣溫將稍為回升。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://www.hko.gov.hk/tc/wxinfo/currwx/fnd.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">九天天氣預報</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:52:22.966088+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T10:06:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T17:34:50.554235+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T10:45:44.112366+00:00","content_hash":"2d58f588ea9a32b9f3669fbe5170d16cf5176940798193ce275741ae3e2e4b2a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}